  "attribution": "來源：《焦氏易林》，易學網《焦氏易林［四庫全書版］》（依據版本：《欽定四庫全書》子部術數類），https://www.eee-learning.com/book/giauii 。依來源要求標示出處及原網頁連結；本站僅整理林辭原文，並記錄收錄、標點及文字整理修改。",
  "entryCount": 64,
  "missingTargets": [],
  "entries": [
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 64,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 64,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 64,
      "hexagramName": "未濟",
      "poemText": "志慢未習，單酒糗脯。數至神前，欲求所願，反得大患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a6b90bbd975406d30c1515774a2bd5995591546edc784678a762312abfee16b3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6e82521568183e806fa636078a0879d5aad63e0634e419f3dc61540602f19eb3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 1,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 1,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 1,
      "hexagramName": "乾",
      "poemText": "且生夕死，名曰嬰鬼，不可得祀。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fecd6a2b32360fd0a925a7396c9a26ea898aaf0969043d1dbb2f4f3ea597b498",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:945b9885c9f46d0a52a127460e8bf74b59e269d3402914f7bb56a28ccd9f0263"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 2,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 2,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 2,
      "hexagramName": "坤",
      "poemText": "大步上車，南至喜家。送我狐裘，與福喜來。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b113a442e79488721ff55c9bea1a7c8f8de56a909a7f7f3e400d5380035e381c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d42df0ff9c62bb46ee1c5a6d12886875a609c9cbacfa9f055ee26880d05a218f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 3,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 3,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 3,
      "hexagramName": "屯",
      "poemText": "西多小星，三五在東。早夜晨行，勞苦無功。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:33490fe4a1a3e31517e23c59eea06b72be6b687a5b9b7fbd842fbc87d7a2b1be",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:df8e014f769044f50e16607cf86f69c6f3f2eb434e24af0adf09f3f0bef31bcf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 4,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 4,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 4,
      "hexagramName": "蒙",
      "poemText": "北陸藏冰，君子心悲。困於粒食，鬼驚我門。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:280eb808cb6cae4b06e1df381bbc815bd420321030bedda9a73e297002ea3a79",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c824aa6d1ab6aaceac69cfa1f1d20d19ceb4b9f7c2ef8e004a2e301853968d4b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 5,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 5,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 5,
      "hexagramName": "需",
      "poemText": "山泉暴怒，壞梁折柱。稽難行旅，留連愁苦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bf0185ebba24af7ce0bff16206ce91707d217d14a8d24dc5e534f9681ffe9433",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1c334672eb4f0a29a66a69e29ac6fa2916312563d1fee7a84a4db10d4afaaa5a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 6,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 6,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 6,
      "hexagramName": "訟",
      "poemText": "比目四翼，來安吾國。福喜上堂，與我同床。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3d8eb977ddd99b4b1119fa50d95b7ed89c2e935d1676f7db8b28da199c7120af",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7cc03dc306f74f605adb51ba7090c8147555247df5cbb515069a6cb396874066"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 7,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 7,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 7,
      "hexagramName": "師",
      "poemText": "狡兔趯趯，良犬逐咋。雄雌爰爰，為鷹所獲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:37c23380054f72de84746832ac3239a8b814a9228c286ad317f190abde83ed10",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c65b2074f3d1c8c559efbbb8a3489b7d5cbf8df0fd465f3ce16a50d3bcdd0b09"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 8,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 8,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 8,
      "hexagramName": "比",
      "poemText": "增祿益福，喜來入室，解除憂惑。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:18f39d1370ade0ec79db7e5c1a417d9279b3c06c2bd89403bdfad7f805da10c1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:660f8210d940a203638f6e57222630ef542661861d16eba4e00c999b8440c394"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 9,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 9,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 9,
      "hexagramName": "小畜",
      "poemText": "騎龍乘鳳，上見神公。彭祖受制，王喬贊通。巫咸就位，拜福無窮。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0bcfb432cd7b18c202f7d5cdb5d7542d085bea6f2d1cef06076de5ba7ad42f4c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:52210a104fd8cf5e54fed69ff81c74aac468bdaa48a3be9fe7ff84ed1cf176b7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 10,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 10,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 10,
      "hexagramName": "履",
      "poemText": "天火卒起，燒我旁里。延及吾家，空盡己財。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:66140e8872bae030ae1bfdeefadbeb0bb02f302a6d4d939a6e414bacdcc0d904",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:91367ded4bb856931bbce38071260b3e603c47567a26a81be5029c1c75b775da"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 11,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 11,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 11,
      "hexagramName": "泰",
      "poemText": "金帛黃寶，宜與我市。嫁娶有息，利得萬倍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:03d616dc82c9836107693292cee3f21782dbd58276cc2d6f488a1f3ab2c9db90",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:251c471366442baac1f77f0ec677d09f9ca0dfba00a2be20f6697fb8f199fbd7"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 12,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 12,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 12,
      "hexagramName": "否",
      "poemText": "鬼魅之居，凶不可舍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:de7d091799916183da4cb76125656187f99520d053a69bee0b6200d6bf5d03d6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ad6e34c98eead0f47dc93483915641cc6916cfe5718fa61ed8c493cdcebaccec"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 13,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 13,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 13,
      "hexagramName": "同人",
      "poemText": "飛鳥逐兔，各有畏惡。鵰鷹為賊，亂我室舍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:f2c61c3183b536069c32c1fc32732efebcfcbbe0a42255ca893ee0e41f6e413d",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:aa5c76e294e09d4989f9b5afe282a31045be6bfc48409a7cc79178db7ded94b8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 14,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 14,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 14,
      "hexagramName": "大有",
      "poemText": "初雖驚惶，後乃無傷，受其福慶。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bdd52ea03c42e498822c09cbcbdddf61bdd02489752269fbc6b2d1c6aea04a62",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:e7ac2361748276ea61041d828ad9821880ccd84658b998e7758b5777fc353a92"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 15,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 15,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 15,
      "hexagramName": "謙",
      "poemText": "兩金相擊，勇氣均敵。日月鬥戰，不破不缺。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b73c1b386723e89217358a5a57918b266230d7208037ed8e100c893be72b9227",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a1d0716958e273d2833fe9f136fe12ad15c43deccb3df02e2b44f7607b712fdd"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 16,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 16,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 16,
      "hexagramName": "豫",
      "poemText": "曳綸河海，掛釣魴鯉。王孫利德，以享仲發。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:9cf7fe1cff3320d831395678c04b57b912d228f96a4fcede5171fe7838bfeb2c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:05c75599ea3c1355626cdd52ac8346345a4a8e2416636984a16ab6212b98144e"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 17,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 17,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 17,
      "hexagramName": "隨",
      "poemText": "犬畏虎狼，依人作輔。三夫執戟，伏不敢起，身安無咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7ed24d4cf5b120f8f779d95929ba1fecb9d2a0b9aa0e9fedcc72562bb82ecab8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2614701cd5629d327d167ddd959d3b441b462d76ff0e45ddd382350f5b9ae726"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 18,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 18,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 18,
      "hexagramName": "蠱",
      "poemText": "蜘蛛作網，以伺行旅。青蠅嚵聚，觸我羅域。為網所得，死於網羅。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:18920c1177917068cac3da8306a5a3285e49bceea3126ca401e12559a52428ca",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:7ab2fe7890c338012bf934752c9fd22afaffb2f3cdc94c26e8ac6a071862da78"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 19,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 19,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 19,
      "hexagramName": "臨",
      "poemText": "所望在外，鼎命方來。拭爵滌罍，炊食待之，不為季憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a184ab5c840b2327b2b661d211b6b59a1daf0a873c92f2f0f222455997fde15f",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:37beffd6715739750e61be387f4a2e72bdbbfaa95c7df241f8b8465346ab25eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 20,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 20,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 20,
      "hexagramName": "觀",
      "poemText": "日月並居，常暗匪明。高山崩顛，丘陵為溪。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:53c5b68e683e243fcbcb2c937413277f8230e6a43833fb9c03b0414037b1ffe3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a5a041df60419f06d86f6140576cc8e369fe533385e614c587abb6761ae69102"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 21,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 21,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 21,
      "hexagramName": "噬嗑",
      "poemText": "春服既成，載華復生。莖葉茂盛，實穗泥泥。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:1724798c56e6f00d1a415581fb894161103b5366e8454ea9cc85deb4097234f8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:600a0adf9de93ed91f48fbf75b54608bd4f14b77d26340093fbb34b8a6cfa8ac"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 22,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 22,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 22,
      "hexagramName": "賁",
      "poemText": "華首山頭，仙道所遊。利以居止，長無咎憂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d6cd7d15ff6042aba6ed982cf5dfca6fa5b45e565ffc97f6e4c28147c99b3020",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:9a06eb57f759f9862cc8453a8c80d69d25a0e2bcbc6d5553ff199c62d01f7145"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 23,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 23,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 23,
      "hexagramName": "剝",
      "poemText": "三狐嗥哭，自悲孤獨。野無所由，死於丘室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:69c3f23db425b04a25be7b01f77363bcd067b817a8bf6d0e44f155258c82036c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:401e9274075bb44474e73f43b43437e2c986928c91a944414416ce61bc3261a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 24,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 24,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 24,
      "hexagramName": "復",
      "poemText": "火中暑退，求藿其食。商人不至，市空無有。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:461e653d90a7a10e286a794305f81b92bb4a1e23e58e0060f1ecb9220c0f407c",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b1efac3214deaf993c91803ba2cd5d40f67d825402188629e5ce3a849e2121bb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 25,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 25,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 25,
      "hexagramName": "无妄",
      "poemText": "獨立山巔，求麋耕田。草木不闢，秋饑無年。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0b300ddeaa78f9b1ce8170e91a6477a99da3678d232e384e1fcda2f448c3fece",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:54758894924743a7cbe45e3252c2cbea8babd9466f7918afb6cc52f3d7648216"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 26,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 26,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 26,
      "hexagramName": "大畜",
      "poemText": "火雖熾，在吾後。寇雖近，在吾右。身安吉，不危殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b365e46164a39e6181a215f7aec66585fbbcfcd1593ce578958b437f7795b746",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d7a147ad23274f50a20f67da1b134c0de141049c510d7d6db6bd77cc5ecee66b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 27,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 27,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 27,
      "hexagramName": "頤",
      "poemText": "，貧鬼相賁。無有懽怡，一日九結。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6a0af28651c3229af6ab087a66296257f77ae236d1b457c41b9d0d5ac376b051",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a322a5db65aef895f3f80c75122e8c3b7583892c1e83421f3466b021f71f0592"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 28,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 28,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 28,
      "hexagramName": "大過",
      "poemText": "追亡逐北，呼還幼叔。至山而得，反歸其室。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:33231a90a46f681774b0fee8c515fe3754e8df1803027280318008810a42d385",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c12163b0dcf637fb737a08a44aaf83dc38b8a052dc23bb8bc14e59ffd2c399eb"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 29,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 29,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 29,
      "hexagramName": "坎",
      "poemText": "銜命辱使，不堪厥事。遂墮落去，更為欺吏。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:43aef26563a1148af4b25c95e87866687354b3260b34f8fcb8fa4c436baf2421",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:1e7e77b223f1229fdab98d4de7debef2b53de83dba00870824312619a13ef68f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 30,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 30,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 30,
      "hexagramName": "離",
      "poemText": "被珠銜玉，沐浴仁德。應聘唐國，四門穆穆。蟊賊不作，凶惡伏匿。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:97e11c4d7314b3c825c3b35bdbae68a6a16d69e000e13996a758ce4fdbf3c86e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d7e0a1ef3e187567f627dc2a2cc818ba4675bddeee0fae18527086c71cb31ddf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 31,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 31,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 31,
      "hexagramName": "咸",
      "poemText": "機關不便，不能出言。精誠適通，為人所冤。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:ad8775ce8da77620902ef88b46b5574648bed1dc75447e4afce745a8567b4ed8",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f5365d2be25fb6aa506958778ef26eeabd2ad2ee16d285a52473e81bb0626779"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 32,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 32,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 32,
      "hexagramName": "恒",
      "poemText": "甕破缶缺，南行凶失。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:07a699a6a8413e68dd5a8e03ede9a03578df67ebe334d8c70727f93fa849c768",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b5846b46cba7b1a0c413b0366485ce65eb61ad1fe82d6be3aed48d076fa5db6c"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 33,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 33,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 33,
      "hexagramName": "遯",
      "poemText": "唇亡齒寒，積日凌根。朽不可用，為身災患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0277403a32925a924d97080f90c37372a746626b2ec90a66da45a4eb085c7de4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5da9939732715cfe3dabfa487c9d1ce7ed29c8a14c02ebfe0c830846336a6e87"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 34,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 34,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 34,
      "hexagramName": "大壯",
      "poemText": "蒙惑憧憧，不知西東。魁罡指南，告我失中。利以宜止，去國憂患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:bdf1081f0c7086f6949698f18a67c3fcd15ee723fe4c7e95c8fed4a27508cab1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c982b42b0fa076ad01ee747b44422812346fa7db85ef9f2ef52b9cc2c1eb06fa"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 35,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 35,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 35,
      "hexagramName": "晉",
      "poemText": "烏鴟搏翼，以避陰賊。盜伺二女，賴厥生福。旱災為疾，君無黍稷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:75ca235228ff138a16205a2ffad39165e21a7b407ff21c52397d018c7f05ee16",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a04fa512d815203d7e9bdce4d91fb81b73ea8068589a6d71cf1d07dabaf8c8a2"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 36,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 36,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 36,
      "hexagramName": "明夷",
      "poemText": "名成德就，項領不試。景公耄耋，尼父避去。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:7cbe240383631789f2197c44b0e4956b917879530674f22531f80cafdcd56cd6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3632f64bc4d963f32c1caab0de5db38bf85e3fdf2a336846e7807a90a1cf103b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 37,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 37,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 37,
      "hexagramName": "家人",
      "poemText": "言與心詭，西行東望。鯀湮洪水，佞賊為禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8f9e3d3a5ae8ebdcc1c73e68b657add904a97de5fd9fc28f8ad8038dc00e3d31",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bda82209a74924ccb71f9258e06062376754a6f7c1c4b96179d194eacaae5fcf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 38,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 38,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 38,
      "hexagramName": "睽",
      "poemText": "獫狁匪度，治兵焦穫。伐鎬及方，與周爭疆。元戎其駕，衰及夷王。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fab5a67ecffd41b339ef57ca2f991efd42985c4b61c2d348bae61ba83fecc0cb",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:a025b881edd61503a5d8807964117243c31895f2dbba5e4e576a48df03c8bb00"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 39,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 39,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 39,
      "hexagramName": "蹇",
      "poemText": "三火起明，雨滅其光。高位疾顛，驕恣誅傷。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:d12b6d7e8df4ab1542935263a97879583994810805c00534a8b4275d935309a0",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:41aa7cabe712a56035bdc438e848ea3a71bd4c4b7d80c4c8878c4c501b5ca09f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 40,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 40,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 40,
      "hexagramName": "解",
      "poemText": "陰涿川決，水為吾祟。使我潰心，毋樹枲麻，居止凶殆。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:e7d8f224f066f3463a096381b29ae6dc98af299569f30688b188cc3279917d91",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:b786fe273248c92a15d3e56b20d065b3561527e7ee5b5cea91afa305f2b68f55"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 41,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 41,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 41,
      "hexagramName": "損",
      "poemText": "厭浥晨夜，道多湛露。沾我襦褲，重難以步。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:041fe9ac7cffbdf8f832a089a5c80aaccc19c82c210709d74f53761a0adaecd3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:29e584c868ece7383c863271b74e9e41463168ba86547e0e890b90102d3f485f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 42,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 42,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 42,
      "hexagramName": "益",
      "poemText": "宜行賈市，所求必倍。載喜抱子，與利為友。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:fe3206609fe9a474f6e0a8ca0bd309bab8ddc6cdde4033fce021565fbf3c2036",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:ef846a9f555bd243520ba0123ed407808f604808cc95bce436f2f3ad6ca05656"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 43,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 43,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 43,
      "hexagramName": "夬",
      "poemText": "陰變為陽，女化為男。治道得通，君臣相承。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5b7b591bc6562471ff56b64e86162bbe8da8d16ac4689df472dd40f512b8e037",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:d871286f96cffb87cfbc1422016237123437b5c54dc6cd43c4dafbb914141b8a"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 44,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 44,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 44,
      "hexagramName": "姤",
      "poemText": "淵蔽杜荊，生蘙山旁。仇敵皆憎，孰肯相迎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:6943c429e7f999b4f443fbea1d644bc66e89d35bd3eb58f77ccd327482292a52",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:81517117ca3418f8331525aec12c8d624dd684c23e66904c49d47a33a01a4d03"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 45,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 45,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 45,
      "hexagramName": "萃",
      "poemText": "坐茵乘軒，握德宰臣。虞叔受命，六合和親。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:5442075f486346327cd2af37cf2af319976bf85abfa9cb601757a3029a90b7b4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c92229c6b5b9e3fb79891e1cc5d3b3a566907062afd2d77317fdb87f41e7cee3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 46,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 46,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 46,
      "hexagramName": "升",
      "poemText": "雲興蔽日，雨集草木，年茂歲熟。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:01ca71f119873a5186dd607eed71943a7c0d6657ad7469ebaad05787cd5242cd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:059a2e14dd5ac1ed454c5b8ba2b3b86ef3c4ad1e5a076edf2772b5155b7dc99d"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 47,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 47,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 47,
      "hexagramName": "困",
      "poemText": "播枝折岐，與母別離。絕不相知",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c3da0d3f67e0acc07ec0adf1e86240b8d62eccabfa9b87e077ce7488912006f1",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:247153e9fec022a076de48dfa404ba10b03f31eca9366c6c366bcea20c692b64"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 48,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 48,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 48,
      "hexagramName": "井",
      "poemText": "天旱水涸，枯槁無澤。困於沙石，未有所獲。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:095aff83a0c15f22eed5969a14fed021e498fde0e3a2e8886c990eb55854823a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:5efeb30f4bda7f0d0db4e8fda19f208072c391d700296c3282ac0b8b4654885b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 49,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 49,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 49,
      "hexagramName": "革",
      "poemText": "圭璧琮璜，執贄見王。百里甯戚，應聘齊秦。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:73a21d8f418d0721f1eb9d7b83ccd9d0d7eca653da8cb64d41de65d983fa9694",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3a3ce0955f7b97354bf1514196293d3a1d6b1b0321d71aefd2e3fd023a3b7230"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 50,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 50,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 50,
      "hexagramName": "鼎",
      "poemText": "龍渴求飲，雲黑景從。河伯捧醴，跪進酒漿，流潦滂滂。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:0ea79cd94e434e9bb88e1db56f387d5a71f7205cc21b180f9b4e7b2fbb88ed6e",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:3c811d603982328f307b50200d594deec08d05625178a64ee0dc20a72d9fcff8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 51,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 51,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 51,
      "hexagramName": "震",
      "poemText": "雹梅零蔕，心思積憤，亂我雲氣。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:353980f02733bdfa6fafa02f5f52210cc1ac577ebdb59c2db429d02d2a6a5920",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0ddf85f7f9acc59bb4b1beb2c9753e52543b0ab0e87c2a73ed7b7d37d9a7c22b"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 52,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 52,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 52,
      "hexagramName": "艮",
      "poemText": "鹿求其子，虎廬之西。唐伯李耳，貪不我許。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:870a2b58ef8bd6548ffc5c06df6582ade63beb18837d11e2cf82f1953ff6638a",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0a8f6e659f83a6420790c35f5606b19b2d641603a3fa7be4ef153ac29f749b48"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 53,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 53,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 53,
      "hexagramName": "漸",
      "poemText": "穿匏挹水，搆銕燃火。勞瘦力竭，飢渴為禍。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:26cfb482afef529ab58c3e99c1a88065464294d404bcaf0aeaed7b68952478a2",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:bca65ed2a87492e411b22b239105dd1b4dc19b49d8084b25ac8f256af4dad342"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 54,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 54,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 54,
      "hexagramName": "歸妹",
      "poemText": "龍生馬淵，壽考且神。舍宿軒轅，居樂常安。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:c4b2c93e4a786ce225f9380be4eb4e62054995ce743e546bb9708fbf0c9703fc",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:6ec2e8e7510d0727abda6a08db55f1a84d64fd731962cf99687bd0e63d5ad2f4"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 55,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 55,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 55,
      "hexagramName": "豐",
      "poemText": "崔嵬北岳，天神貴客。溫仁正直，主布恩德。衣冠不已，蒙受大福。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:a87d667a0ddf5b27d2a0a007adad34222f29771e2a91e74154a1b37195c901a4",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:c209acb39a0bc6b8bfd5ce7cc79687cc17ae996d9dec259a7ed5666996fe8dbf"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 56,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 56,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 56,
      "hexagramName": "旅",
      "poemText": "鬼夜哭泣，齊失其國，為下所賊。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:b6d2f32dc7f56142120d7fc887b146c9616f6c541507e6fa4ffe30249b066517",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:20533bb9237142ac16cfeaeae652316d55609c0735b04693046211d7c97e9191"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 57,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 57,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 57,
      "hexagramName": "巽",
      "poemText": "二政多門，君失其權。三家專制，禍起季孫。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:43d1204614fb8a4658d0dd5202607d7d161479b41ea4675650035c2242eac4ab",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:f94feedc4dcf66cf4747d981bb59b914bec8a855ca8c914c86ca4ff2e5a3373f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 58,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 58,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 58,
      "hexagramName": "兌",
      "poemText": "望幸不到，文章未就。三子逐兔，犬踦不得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:59b227ae1a1b2ccc2d88e92c43b5b04c0b050a48e186d646624995e1d0c442fd",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2c42996538dfca390df38e6599268b5cf6d759ced42f8196a7b788200fff804f"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 59,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 59,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 59,
      "hexagramName": "渙",
      "poemText": "伯虎仲熊，德義淵弘。使布五教，陰陽順序。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:510c5306250657293a09111dfacf0a8204586ad915409ddb2ad65c22733a48e6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:8caaf3b5a29103a14edd23e508077d27d46aa5a5bd5556163f2b432a7cf1f1a9"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 60,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 60,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 60,
      "hexagramName": "節",
      "poemText": "兩足四翼，飛入家國。寧我伯姊，與母相得。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:23feaa4a4e327df87dbe9234c96c68460ccb2793c538119f20e9796d294b50f3",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:2ea67150e556d771e1b20b1d1a023b33f6bd627ac02f1337ded14e105afbe4d3"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 61,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 61,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 61,
      "hexagramName": "中孚",
      "poemText": "春秋禱祝，解禍除憂，君無災咎。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:74ab7a6f09c4c005ad332d8ef7b06be5ae2967f55c21bd19823969441703ba50",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:0ec885f1cf144e12deb59d3b70cca3d5c956641de9de5fdb062817f03c42b1f8"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 62,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 62,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 62,
      "hexagramName": "小過",
      "poemText": "牧羊稻園，聞虎喧讙。畏懼悚息，終無禍患。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:8e5c0cbfd7686c5f41b57b80d34a8a99a8e0d05a408e15e6c73f4b026c6e7474",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:39f4249f830b65db0cefe70f6572e8bd95dd38846338d5c9b0050fa50f7fa558"
    },
    {
      "baseHexagramNumber": 64,
      "changedHexagramNumber": 63,
      "sourceEntryNumber": 63,
      "sourceIconHexagramNumber": 63,
      "hexagramName": "既濟",
      "poemText": "大蛇巨魚，相搏於郊。君臣隔塞，郭公出廬。",
      "sourceParagraphSha256": "sha256:3d90e1039e709381fb11a56da6498566b5749999ddeb873cc759d636648e4df6",
      "sourceLabelIconMismatch": false,
      "textSha256": "sha256:58573ab9948e882e53010d7ef088a235cb1854d535b262ab6d54581a44b023df"
    }
  ]
}
